# ...but generated artifacts that tasks are scoped from MUST be committed.
# `docs/pine_builtin_coverage.csv` is PINEBI-0's only deliverable: without it a
# clone skips 8 of the 12 guards in tests/test_pine_coverage_csv.py and the
# PINEBI-1b..1e scopes point at nothing.
!docs/pine_builtin_coverage.csv
data/datas.csv
data/f500.csv
data/GLD_D_tv.csv
data/SPY_5min.csv
data/SPY_1min.csv
data/SPY_D_TV1.csv
data/SPY_D_TV2.csv
data/SPY_D_TV3.csv
data/TV_5min.csv
data/tulip.csv
examples/*.csv

# The TradingView pine corpus is a WORKING INPUT, not a distributable.
# 2,211 files / 46MB, of which 912 carry `Mozilla Public License 2.0` / `(c)
# TradingView` and the remainder are community scripts with no stated licence.
# Shipping them under this repo's root MIT LICENSE would misstate their terms,
# and `pip install git+...` would clone 46MB the package never reads.
# Untracked 2026-09-07; `docs/gen_pine_builtin_coverage.py` reads it locally.
docs/pine/
